 "scope": "The mechanics of the build screen solved a second time, by a second program: the cells, the lumps, the temperatures at the end of each lump and the declared material are those of build_sim.py (params/build-sim-case.json, params/build-sim.json). Nothing here is a new hypothesis; only the solver changes, and with it the size of model this host can run.",
 "input_audit": {
  "geometry": "the print-body occupancy (params/print-body.json) cut into cells by build_sim.py prepare, flange y+ on the plate",
